[ti:Tadbeer Barbaad]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sufi & Qawwali]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Log kahte hain tere hone se meri tadbeer barbaad hai
[00:13.90]Log kahte hain... log kahte hain...
[00:19.81]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon ye goonge ke gud ka swaad hai
[00:25.71]Wo kahte hain diya hawa ke saamne kyun jalaye rakha hai
[00:31.61]Ye to bujh jayega, ye to mit jayega, ye to khaak mein mil jayega
[00:37.52]Main kahta hoon isi jalte rehne mein mere dil ka thikana hai
[00:43.42]Jalna hi jalna hai, jalna hi paana hai — bujhna to andhera hai
[00:49.33]Poochhte hain zakhm kyun nahi bhartaa, kyun hardam rota rehta hai
[00:55.23]Kya itna sasta hai tera dard ki har baazaar mein bikta hai
[01:01.13]Main kahta hoon har zakhm teri yaad ka kinaara hai
[01:07.04]Ghaav hi to wo aaina hai jisme tera chehra utarta hai
[01:12.94]Wo kahte hain ke diya baati ke mainu jalaye lagaa rakhya hai
[01:18.84]Hawa jab aavegi, ye diya bujh jaavega, sirf dhuan reh jaavega
[01:24.75]Main kahta hoon sakhi! ye jalna hi mere preetam ko paana hai
[01:30.65]Je diya bujh gaya, taan baati kya? saans lena hi bekaar hai
[01:36.55]Jogi ban ke aaya tha, preetam rang diya
[01:48.36]Barbaadi de vich goonge jiha har koi
[02:00.17]Gud ka swaad jaane par bole na
[02:11.98]Log kahte hain...
[02:23.78]Tere hone se...
[02:35.59]Meri tadbeer barbaad hai
[02:47.40]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon...
[02:59.20]Ye goonge ke gud ka swaad hai
[03:05.11]Hey Maula, hey Shah-e-Braj Nandlala
[03:11.01]Hey Khwaja Chishti di dargah da ujiyara
[03:16.91]Jehda preet vich goonga ho jaave
[03:22.82]Usnu gud da swaad baksh de
[03:28.72]Jehdi tadbeer barbaad ho jaave
[03:34.63]Usnu wafa da naam baksh de
[03:40.53]Ameen...
[03:46.43]Ameen...
[03:52.34]Ameen...
